<title>AUSTRIA: Kies-Union suspended in Vienna-bourse.</title>
<headline>Kies-Union suspended in Vienna-bourse.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Kies-Union AG, Austria's largest supplier of sand and gravel, will be suspended from trade on Friday pending an important announcement, the Vienna stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Kies-Union, a unit of Britain's Readymix RMC Group plc, declined to comment on the suspension.</p>
<p>Rumours have been circulating in Vienna that Kies-Union and Austrian cement producer Lieferbeton may combine some activities. Readymix also holds a majority stake in Lieferbeton. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
